## Auth Setup

{{#if (eq auth "better-auth:stateless")}}
Configure the Better Auth secret, URL and external OIDC provider settings. Register the callback URL with your provider. Stateless auth requires no authentication schema generation or database migration.
{{else}}
Follow the ordered steps in Setup. Run the generated `auth:generate` script in `apps/api-gateway` before applying the database schema and regenerating Prisma Client in `packages/db`. The script uses the installed CLI version and preserves application-owned models.
{{/if}}

### Usage

Access the authenticated user's session in any controller with full type safety (including better-auth plugins):

```typescript
import { Controller, Get } from "@nestjs/common";
import { Session } from "@thallesp/nestjs-better-auth";
import type { UserSession } from "./auth/auth.js";

@Controller()
export class AppController {
  @Get()
  getSession(@Session() session: UserSession): UserSession {
    return session;
  }
}
```
{{/if}}
